# The extension ships the bundled server produced by `bun run build`, nothing else.
# `bun build` inlines every JavaScript dependency into build/index.js, so node_modules
# is not needed at runtime and would otherwise add ~19MB of mostly dead weight.
#
# Ignore everything at the top level, then re-include the few paths the extension needs.
/*

!/manifest.json
!/icon.png
!/LICENSE
!/README.md

# Negate the directory without a trailing slash as well, otherwise the packer -
# which tests paths like "build" while walking - never descends into it.
!/build
!/build/**
